howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 2
inconsistent false
omitted 2
omission SameIndividual(http://example.org/t#a http://example.org/t#b)
omission SubClassOf(http://example.org/t#Q ObjectOneOf(http://example.org/t#b))
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 7
sub http://example.org/t#C http://example.org/t#C
sub http://example.org/t#C http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#D http://example.org/t#D
sub http://example.org/t#D http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#Q http://example.org/t#Q
sub http://example.org/t#Q http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
